# StickLab OS package list — coding + learn-Linux + Labwc desktop + GPU, budgeted <2GB USB image.
# GPU: NVIDIA (open modules + userspace = CUDA-ready) + AMD/Intel Vulkan + OpenCL loader.
# Languages pre-installed: C/C++, Python, Go, Node, Rust, Java-runtime, Ruby, PHP, Lua, Perl.
# Full JDK / CUDA toolkit install on demand via `sticklab setup-gpu` / pacman (online).

# --- base system ---
base
linux
linux-firmware
intel-ucode
amd-ucode
sof-firmware
systemd
systemd-sysvcompat
pacman
glibc
bash
coreutils
shadow
sudo

# --- shells + editors (choice, not opinionated) ---
nano
neovim
zsh
zsh-autosuggestions
zsh-syntax-highlighting
tmux

# --- coding toolchains (pre-downloaded) ---
gcc
make
pkgconf
patch
git
python
python-pip
go
rust
rustup
nodejs
sqlite
ruby
php
lua
perl
jre-openjdk-headless

